l":6},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"set","text":"set()","level":4},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"key-3","text":"key","level":6},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":6},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"persistence","text":"persistence","level":3},{"id":"row","text":"row","level":3},{"id":"delete-2","text":"delete()","level":4},{"id":"parameters-5","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"key-4","text":"key","level":6},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"get-2","text":"get()","level":4},{"id":"parameters-6","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"key-5","text":"key","level":6},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"set-2","text":"set()","level":4},{"id":"parameters-7","text":"Parameters","level":5},{"id":"key-6","text":"key","level":6},{"id":"metadata","text":"metadata","level":6},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":5}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:482](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L482)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number` = `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Properties\n\n### collection\n\n```ts\ncollection: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:490](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L490)\n\n#### delete()\n\n```ts\ndelete: (key) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### get()\n\n```ts\nget: (key) => unknown;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### list()\n\n```ts\nlist: (prefix?) => readonly object[];\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### prefix?\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\nreadonly `object`[]\n\n#### set()\n\n```ts\nset: (key, value) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`string`\n\n###### value\n\n`unknown`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### persistence\n\n```ts\npersistence: \n  | SyncPersistenceCapabilityV1<TKey>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:508](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L508)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nUnstable, versioned bridge between persistence-aware collection adapters\nand sync adapters. Application code should not construct this capability.\nCustom adapter wrappers must forward it unchanged. `null` explicitly means\nthat the collection has no persistence capability; a missing property is\ninvalid.\n\n Adapter infrastructure; not an application-facing API.\n\n***\n\n### row\n\n```ts\nrow: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:485](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L485)\n\n#### delete()\n\n```ts\ndelete: (key) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`TKey`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### get()\n\n```ts\nget: (key) => unknown;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`TKey`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### set()\n\n```ts\nset: (key, metadata) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`TKey`\n\n###### metadata\n\n`unknown`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SyncMetadataApi\ntitle: SyncMetadataApi\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:482](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L482)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number` = `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Properties\n\n### collection\n\n```ts\ncollection: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:490](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L490)\n\n#### delete()\n\n```ts\ndelete: (key) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### get()\n\n```ts\nget: (key) => unknown;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### list()\n\n```ts\nlist: (prefix?) => readonly object[];\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### prefix?\n\n`string`\n\n##### Returns\n\nreadonly `object`[]\n\n#### set()\n\n```ts\nset: (key, value) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`string`\n\n###### value\n\n`unknown`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### persistence\n\n```ts\npersistence: \n  | SyncPersistenceCapabilityV1<TKey>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:508](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L508)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nUnstable, versioned bridge between persistence-aware collection adapters\nand sync adapters. Application code should not construct this capability.\nCustom adapter wrappers must forward it unchanged. `null` explicitly means\nthat the collection has no persistence capability; a missing property is\ninvalid.\n\n Adapter infrastructure; not an application-facing API.\n\n***\n\n### row\n\n```ts\nrow: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:485](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L485)\n\n#### delete()\n\n```ts\ndelete: (key) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`TKey`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### get()\n\n```ts\nget: (key) => unknown;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`TKey`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n#### set()\n\n```ts\nset: (key, metadata) => void;\n```\n\n##### Parameters\n\n###### key\n\n`TKey`\n\n###### metadata\n\n`unknown`\n\n##### Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
